<div class="mb-12" data-reveal>
  <h2 class="mb-5 text-[26px] font-semibold leading-[1.2] tracking-tight text-[#111827] md:text-[30px]">The AI hype vs reality</h2>
  <p class="mb-5 text-[16px] leading-relaxed text-[#6B7280] md:text-[17px]">
    <strong class="font-semibold text-[#111827]">79% of Nepali industries</strong> are not yet ready for AI adoption. That's not necessarily a problem. Not every business process benefits from AI, and rushing into AI can waste resources on solutions that don't fit.
  </p>
  <p class="text-[16px] leading-relaxed text-[#6B7280] md:text-[17px]">
    This whitepaper provides a practical decision framework for Kathmandu enterprises. When does AI deliver clear ROI? When is traditional software the better choice? And when should you consider hybrid approaches?
  </p>
</div>

