          <span class="text-[16px] font-medium leading-snug text-[#111827] transition-colors group-hover:text-navy-600 sm:text-[17px]">Is AI always more expensive than traditional software?</span>
          <span class="flex h-6 w-6 flex-shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full border border-navy-200 text-navy-500 transition-transform duration-200" :class="activeIndex === 1 ? 'rotate-45' : ''">
