          <p class="pt-3 pr-10 text-[14px] leading-relaxed text-[#6B7280] sm:text-[15px]">Not necessarily. Cloud AI services (chatbots, document processing) can be cheaper than custom development. The cost depends on the use case, not the technology. This whitepaper includes cost comparison frameworks.</p>
