          <p class="pt-3 pr-10 text-[14px] leading-relaxed text-[#6B7280] sm:text-[15px]">Many successful implementations combine AI and traditional software. AI handles ambiguous inputs, traditional rules handle clear-cut cases. The whitepaper covers patterns for hybrid architectures.</p>
